    "notes": "21 bars on 2 pages: pickup bar of one eighth (measure 0, implicit) and an incomplete final bar of 5 eighths (2.5 quarters) - neither may be padded. Ties: c'' 2->3, f' 4->5 (across the system break AND the 3/4->4/4 change), g' 9->10->11 (across the page break), c'' 12->13, f' 14->15, d'' inside 17, f' 19->20. Slurs on repeated pitches are NOT ties: bar 4 f'16-(f'4 (two attacks), bar 7 c''16-(c''8 (two attacks). Double-dotted values: g'4.. + f'16, d''4.. + c''16, f'2.. + r8, bes'8.. + a'32. Time signatures 3/4, 4/4 (bar 5), 3/4 (8), 6/8 (12), 9/8 (18), 3/4 (19). One lyric line (stanzas 1 and 2 through-composed): one syllable per attack, none on tie continuations, melismas with extenders (\"you\", \"bling\", \"-ing\", \"heads\").",
